{"id":"sapin","lemma":"sapin","pos":"noun","rank":4108,"glosses":["fir, fir tree"],"ipa":"/sa.pɛ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/33/Fr-sapin.ogg/Fr-sapin.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"sapins"},"formAudio":{"sapins":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/63/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-sapins.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est un sapin.","en":"That's a fir tree.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Avez-vous un sapin de Noël ?","en":"Do you have a Christmas tree?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"Christmas"}]},{"text":"Il y a beaucoup de cadeaux sous le sapin.","en":"There are a lot of gifts under the Christmas tree.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"present, gift","l":"cadeau"},{"g":"below, under"},{"g":"the / it"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"ago"]]},{"text":"Quand montez-vous votre sapin de Noël ?","en":"When do you put up your Christmas tree?","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"to go up, to climb","l":"monter"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"Christmas"}]},{"text":"Les sapins sont souvent utilisés comme arbres de Noël.","en":"Fir trees are often used as Christmas trees.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"often"},{"g":"used, in use","l":"utilisé"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"tree","l":"arbre"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"Christmas"}]}]}